story-context.interfaces:
**ErrorDisplayProps Interface:**
```typescript
interface ErrorDisplayProps {
  error: ErrorResponse;
  onRetry?: () => void; // Optional - can clear error or refocus input
}
```

**ErrorResponse Interface (from types/api.ts):**
```typescript
interface ErrorResponse {
  error: ErrorCode; // 'invalid_location' | 'service_unavailable' | 'timeout' | 'network_error'
  message: string; // User-friendly message from backend
  suggestions?: string[]; // Only present for invalid_location errors
}
```

**Integration with page.tsx:**
```typescript
// State management in page.tsx
const [errorData, setErrorData] = useState(null);

// Error state handling in handleSubmit
if (response.ok) {
  setAnswerData(data);
  setErrorData(null);
} else {
  setErrorData(data); // Backend ErrorResponse
  setAnswerData(null);
}

// Network error handling in catch block
catch {
  setErrorData({
    error: 'network_error',
    message: 'Network connection failed. Please check your internet and try again.',
  });
}

// Conditional rendering
{errorData &&  inputRef.current?.focus()} />}
```

