```

**Backend API Error Contract (Epic 2):**
- POST /api/check-rain returns ErrorResponse with HTTP status codes:
  - 400: Invalid request (empty location) → invalid_request
  - 404: Location not found → invalid_location (may include suggestions)
  - 500: Server error / API failure → service_unavailable
  - 504: Timeout (>5s) → timeout
- Frontend catch block handles network errors → network_error
